title: Potato
---
Potato: Hello!! Have you come to eat hamburgers with me? Or maybe... to play THE GAME?? #line:Potato-2
-> I brought you an invitation!  #line:0991de5 
    Potato: A party? With *music* and *snacks* and *burgers*?!  #line:0768ad9 
    Potato: YES. But wait! I can only party with CHAMPIONS. You must first beat me... in HIDE AND SEEK!  #line:0d5bf93 
    Potato: But be warned, when we start, I go POOF! You won't see me until you FIND ME!  #line:059c5e3 
    -> I'm ready!  #line:056a598 
        <<start_quest "Hide'n'Seek">>
        Let's play! I'm hiding near something crispy and DELICIOUS.  #line:0a022cd 
        <<teleport_potato>>
-> What's “THE GAME”? #line:0652d2a 
    Potato: THE GAME is everything! THE GAME is the best! THE GAME is... HIDE AND SEEK!!  #line:097c384 
    Potato: I'm the undisputed champion. But if you want me at your party, you'll have to BEAT ME!  #line:0d52b8a 
    Potato: But be warned, when we start, I go POOF! You won't see me until you FIND ME!  #line:06691c9 
    -> I'm in! #line:0301740 
        <<start_quest "Hide'n'Seek">>
        First round: I'm hiding near something crispy and DELICIOUS.  #line:0649717 
        <<teleport_potato>>
-> I was just looking around. #line:033b880 
    Potato: That's how all great adventures start! And they end... with potatoes.  #line:0086743 
